WEBVTT

01:30.860 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.350 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 9]

01:40.350 --> 01:41.000
No.

01:41.430 --> 01:42.400
No, no.

01:42.840 --> 01:44.570
I need a drink to calm my nerves.

01:46.870 --> 01:48.400
Good thing I wasn't there.

01:48.509 --> 01:50.509
If I'd seen you
making lampblack blindfolded,

01:50.509 --> 01:51.680
my heart would have...

01:51.680 --> 01:53.810
would have leapt right out of my chest!

01:54.150 --> 01:54.920
Zhen,

01:55.229 --> 01:56.640
you should avoid doing

01:56.640 --> 01:58.070
such risky things in the future.

01:58.070 --> 01:58.840
Mother,

01:58.950 --> 02:00.350
my lampblack-making skill was taught

02:00.350 --> 02:01.400
by Grandfather himself.

02:01.400 --> 02:02.070
I couldn't go wrong.

02:02.070 --> 02:03.800
It was nerve-wracking enough!

02:08.680 --> 02:09.479
Grandfather,

02:09.840 --> 02:10.520
Mother,

02:10.960 --> 02:12.420
Brother, Sister-in-law,

02:12.430 --> 02:13.710
demonstrating my lampblack-making
in front of everyone

02:13.710 --> 02:15.310
may not have been a bad thing.

02:15.560 --> 02:16.400
From now on, I don't think

02:16.400 --> 02:17.310
any ink workshop

02:17.310 --> 02:19.280
will make things difficult for me anymore.

02:19.280 --> 02:20.310
In the future, I

02:20.400 --> 02:21.750
want to take on outsourced lampblack work

02:21.750 --> 02:24.079
from various ink workshops
to earn a living.

02:24.079 --> 02:25.150
Over the past three years,

02:25.150 --> 02:26.630
besides Grandfather's careful instruction,

02:26.630 --> 02:29.120
every hot meal Mother left
outside the ink workshop,

02:29.120 --> 02:30.310
and every coin my brother

02:30.310 --> 02:32.190
and sister-in-law scraped together for me—

02:32.190 --> 02:34.250
I've kept all of it deeply in my heart.

02:34.520 --> 02:35.190
From now on,

02:35.590 --> 02:37.520
it'll be my turn to take care of you.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.680
Look how excited you are.

02:43.680 --> 02:44.280
Hurry up.

02:44.280 --> 02:45.240
Eat up, eat.

02:45.240 --> 02:46.560
Mother, just let me finish.

02:46.560 --> 02:47.150
I've been waiting three years

02:47.150 --> 02:48.150
just to say all this.

02:48.150 --> 02:49.310
Alright, go ahead.

02:49.750 --> 02:50.400
Mother,

02:50.470 --> 02:51.280
well,

02:51.400 --> 02:53.000
I've only studied ink-making
for three years,

02:53.000 --> 02:54.840
and I've already produced
supreme-grade lampblack.

02:54.840 --> 02:56.240
The master craftsmen at other workshops

02:56.240 --> 02:57.310
may not even be able to do that.

02:57.310 --> 02:57.910
Exactly.

02:58.030 --> 02:58.840
In the future,

02:58.960 --> 03:00.240
just by making lampblack alone,

03:00.240 --> 03:02.190
I can earn enough to support the family.

03:02.190 --> 03:03.430
Once I earn enough,

03:03.630 --> 03:05.310
I'll buy us a new house.

03:05.400 --> 03:07.150
We'll all move in and live together.

03:07.150 --> 03:08.350
Zhengliang, you see,

03:08.400 --> 03:10.030
one jar of supreme-grade lampblack

03:10.030 --> 03:11.520
is worth two taels of silver.

03:11.520 --> 03:12.800
Do you know how many jars

03:12.800 --> 03:13.710
of supreme-grade lampblack

03:13.710 --> 03:15.120
it would take to buy a new house?

03:15.120 --> 03:16.000
And I can't always

03:16.000 --> 03:17.860
make this much every time either.

03:20.430 --> 03:22.090
I didn't teach you ink-making

03:22.190 --> 03:24.250
so you could become a common laborer.

03:45.400 --> 03:46.200
Grandfather?

03:56.840 --> 03:57.640
Grandfather,

03:58.000 --> 03:59.120
I was wrong.

03:59.430 --> 04:00.630
Please have some tea.

04:06.430 --> 04:07.310
Grandfather,

04:07.430 --> 04:08.910
I just thought

04:08.910 --> 04:10.960
since our family might
finally have good days ahead,

04:10.960 --> 04:12.030
I was just so excited

04:12.030 --> 04:13.680
that I got carried away.

04:21.310 --> 04:22.630
Grandfather, rest assured.

04:22.630 --> 04:24.310
I've never forgotten the Way of Ink

04:24.310 --> 04:25.830
you taught me.

04:27.480 --> 04:28.830
Remain upright and honorable,

04:28.830 --> 04:30.920
and put the inheritance
of the Way of Ink above all else.

04:30.920 --> 04:32.240
I've only just begun.

04:32.920 --> 04:34.180
The path of ink-making

04:34.390 --> 04:35.680
is full of hardships.

04:35.720 --> 04:37.680
I must guard against
arrogance and impatience,

04:37.680 --> 04:39.190
and remain vigilant and single-minded.

04:39.190 --> 04:39.870
Ink-making

04:39.920 --> 04:41.190
requires an undivided mind—

04:41.190 --> 04:44.050
only then can one walk
the great and righteous path!

04:44.750 --> 04:45.550
Grandfather,

04:45.560 --> 04:46.510
am I right?

04:49.070 --> 04:50.190
Then let me ask you—

04:50.800 --> 04:51.800
what is

04:52.600 --> 04:54.860
the most essential thing in ink-making?

04:54.980 --> 04:56.490
The most crucial step

04:56.520 --> 04:57.300
is naturally the glue-blending.

04:57.300 --> 04:58.960
That is merely the technique.

05:05.120 --> 05:06.070
What is the Way?

05:06.560 --> 05:07.690
What Way do you hold?

05:07.830 --> 05:09.160
And how do you uphold it?

05:17.630 --> 05:19.390
The most essential thing

05:20.510 --> 05:22.170
can be summed up in four words—

05:25.630 --> 05:27.160
to remain true throughout.

05:29.120 --> 05:30.520
Remain true throughout?

05:31.390 --> 05:32.190
Grandfather,

05:32.680 --> 05:34.360
true to what?

05:35.600 --> 05:36.630
To

05:37.310 --> 05:39.070
your Way of Ink—

05:40.430 --> 05:42.490
the principles by which you make ink.

05:43.830 --> 05:45.690
Each person's path is different,

05:46.390 --> 05:47.070
but

05:47.120 --> 05:48.920
once you find yours,

05:49.480 --> 05:51.270
you must hold fast to it
with perseverance,

05:51.270 --> 05:52.560
unwavering resolve,

05:52.680 --> 05:54.390
and steadfast devotion.

05:57.390 --> 05:59.050
Let no hardship or temptation

05:59.720 --> 06:00.980
from the outside world

06:01.070 --> 06:02.670
ever shake your conviction.

06:03.240 --> 06:04.900
You still have a long way to go.

06:09.480 --> 06:10.280
Grandfather,

06:10.510 --> 06:12.160
though I haven't yet

06:12.240 --> 06:13.430
found it,

06:13.830 --> 06:15.030
please rest assured.

06:15.360 --> 06:17.920
I will never stray
from the path of ink-making.

06:17.920 --> 06:19.650
Because I have you here with me!

06:22.530 --> 06:24.120
That said, after trudging along
the great path for a while,

06:24.120 --> 06:26.120
taking a detour now and then
to earn some money wouldn't hurt—

06:26.120 --> 06:28.390
it would make life a little easier
for the family, right?

06:28.390 --> 06:29.390
But rest assured,

06:29.480 --> 06:31.480
it won't affect my Way at all.

06:31.480 --> 06:33.740
I'm just taking a breather along the way.

06:39.190 --> 06:41.630
If only your ink-making skills

06:42.070 --> 06:43.920
were as sharp

06:43.920 --> 06:44.780
as your tongue.

06:45.430 --> 06:47.000
All show and no substance.

06:49.360 --> 06:50.159
Remember,

06:51.680 --> 06:53.080
remain true throughout.

06:53.360 --> 06:55.820
Essence and function
share the same source.

07:03.510 --> 07:04.950
Remain true throughout.

07:04.950 --> 07:06.480
Essence and function
share the same source.

07:06.480 --> 07:07.540
Tea, Grandfather.

07:39.490 --> 07:40.690
Thank you, Sister,

07:40.720 --> 07:43.180
for taking care of Yihousheng
for me lately.

07:43.510 --> 07:45.600
Xue did a good job.

07:45.600 --> 07:47.730
I simply took over at the right moment.

07:50.270 --> 07:51.630
You've just arrived in Huizhou.

07:51.630 --> 07:52.870
What are your plans?

07:54.600 --> 07:55.600
As the saying goes,

07:55.600 --> 07:57.200
"Huizhou has two treasures—

07:57.270 --> 07:59.390
Hui Tea, fragrant for a thousand years,

07:59.390 --> 08:00.390
and Hui Ink,

08:00.390 --> 08:01.790
priceless beyond gold."

08:02.480 --> 08:03.630
Since you

08:03.750 --> 08:05.800
have gone into the Hui Tea trade,

08:05.950 --> 08:06.950
I

08:07.000 --> 08:09.680
will naturally pursue ink.

08:11.480 --> 08:12.750
Your family

08:12.800 --> 08:14.460
has made ink for generations.

08:14.800 --> 08:16.560
It's no surprise you'd want to

08:16.560 --> 08:17.890
enter the ink industry.

08:18.430 --> 08:19.390
But

08:19.430 --> 08:21.480
since you want to focus on ink,

08:21.830 --> 08:23.830
why open this pawnshop?

08:26.040 --> 08:26.950
Sister,

08:27.390 --> 08:29.720
I'm currently using an assumed identity.

08:29.830 --> 08:31.630
If I rashly open an ink workshop

08:31.630 --> 08:33.429
and force my way to claim a share,

08:33.750 --> 08:35.610
it will likely arouse suspicion.

08:38.200 --> 08:41.059
Besides, I never learned
how to make ink growing up.

08:41.549 --> 08:43.549
If I were to take up the family trade,

08:44.360 --> 08:45.690
I fear I would only end up

08:46.080 --> 08:48.410
tarnishing my family's once-great name.

08:53.150 --> 08:54.120
Yesterday,

08:54.200 --> 08:55.670
on my way to Yihousheng,

08:55.790 --> 08:57.080
I caught sight of you

08:57.200 --> 08:58.200
from a distance,

08:58.200 --> 09:00.600
bidding a high price
for a jar of lampblack.

09:04.150 --> 09:05.000
That's right.

09:06.270 --> 09:07.270
Yihousheng

09:07.480 --> 09:08.870
will open in a few days.

09:09.150 --> 09:11.030
I want to make all of Huizhou

09:11.030 --> 09:12.840
curious about my identity

09:12.960 --> 09:15.690
so I can stir up anticipation
before the opening.

09:15.840 --> 09:16.720
I noticed

09:16.750 --> 09:18.440
the Tians were there too.

09:19.150 --> 09:21.720
Do you really have no other intentions?

09:29.390 --> 09:30.600
When I found out

09:30.670 --> 09:31.670
you'd asked the General

09:31.670 --> 09:33.440
for the commission
to procure military supplies

09:33.440 --> 09:34.670
and insisted on returning to Huizhou,

09:34.670 --> 09:36.470
I knew you were here for revenge.

09:37.470 --> 09:38.450
But you must remember:

09:38.450 --> 09:41.510
you came back this time
after making a military pledge.

09:41.550 --> 09:44.440
If you can't raise 10,000 taels for
military provisions within half a year,

09:44.440 --> 09:48.570
you will have to return the pawnshop
and be stripped of your military post.

09:49.000 --> 09:49.670
Brother,

09:50.000 --> 09:52.600
we've benefited from
the General's kindness for many years.

09:52.600 --> 09:53.910
If you act rashly

09:53.910 --> 09:56.510
and do something against
the General's interests,

09:56.510 --> 09:57.630
don't blame me

09:58.390 --> 10:00.390
for setting aside our bonds.

10:02.600 --> 10:03.860
Sister, rest assured.

10:04.030 --> 10:05.120
I know

10:05.360 --> 10:06.720
what's at stake.

10:07.600 --> 10:10.390
Moreover, General Yu
has shown me great kindness,

10:10.390 --> 10:12.030
and I will never forget it.

10:18.360 --> 10:20.090
Don't blame me for being harsh.

10:20.670 --> 10:21.790
Some things

10:22.150 --> 10:23.870
must be said up front.

10:26.480 --> 10:28.200
Now, I know your plan

10:28.520 --> 10:30.560
regarding the purchase
of military supplies.

10:30.560 --> 10:32.270
But what's your plan
regarding the blood feud

10:32.270 --> 10:34.200
between your family and the Tians?

10:39.200 --> 10:40.510
Tian Huai'an...

10:41.550 --> 10:44.360
For decades he bowed and scraped
before my family,

10:44.960 --> 10:47.120
all while plotting to seize
our estate and business

10:47.120 --> 10:49.250
to elevate his own family's standing.

10:50.200 --> 10:52.600
Since he values
the glory of his ink so much,

10:52.870 --> 10:55.550
I will make him lose everything

10:55.870 --> 10:57.470
at the very peak of his glory.

10:58.510 --> 10:59.390
This year

11:00.080 --> 11:02.480
is the year
of the Tribute Ink competition.

11:02.510 --> 11:04.040
It's the best opportunity.

11:04.480 --> 11:06.240
Since you're not opening an ink workshop,

11:06.240 --> 11:07.840
how do you intend to proceed?

11:10.120 --> 11:12.910
There are many
renowned ink-making families in Huizhou.

11:12.910 --> 11:14.440
I'll assess them one by one

11:14.840 --> 11:16.970
and choose a family to cooperate with.

11:17.480 --> 11:19.010
The Tribute Ink commission

11:19.120 --> 11:21.250
is no longer held
by Hui Ink merchants.

11:21.630 --> 11:23.480
The once-prosperous Li Ink

11:24.030 --> 11:25.270
has also declined.

11:25.960 --> 11:26.960
Chen Ink

11:27.270 --> 11:28.150
and Pan Ink

11:28.440 --> 11:30.120
have always been mediocre.

11:31.080 --> 11:32.680
Among all the Hui Ink makers,

11:33.000 --> 11:34.390
only Tian Ink

11:34.440 --> 11:35.630
stands at the top.

11:35.790 --> 11:36.480
Moreover,

11:36.480 --> 11:39.870
the Tian family has close ties with
Shexian Magistrate Zhao Shen.

11:39.870 --> 11:41.390
If you try to unite another family

11:41.390 --> 11:42.630
against them,

11:43.320 --> 11:44.840
it won't be easy.

11:45.600 --> 11:46.550
Zhao Shen?

11:48.960 --> 11:51.090
They'd better stay alive long enough.

12:02.830 --> 12:05.370
[Luo's Ancestral Hall]

12:37.480 --> 12:39.120
The officers will raze this place
to the ground

12:39.120 --> 12:40.920
and wipe out your entire family!

12:42.000 --> 12:43.200
Young Master!

12:53.600 --> 12:55.390
Ancestors of the Luo family,

12:59.150 --> 12:59.750
I...

13:02.600 --> 13:03.840
I'm back.

13:05.750 --> 13:06.750
Three years ago,

13:07.240 --> 13:08.870
as a fugitive,

13:09.320 --> 13:11.980
I finally found General Yu
after much hardship.

13:14.600 --> 13:17.000
Out of the friendship
he shared with Father,

13:17.000 --> 13:19.600
he took me into Marshal Qi's army
at great risk.

13:21.030 --> 13:22.200
I never expected

13:22.320 --> 13:24.150
that a jest I'd made back then

13:26.030 --> 13:27.630
would come true today.

13:31.270 --> 13:33.870
From now on, your name will be Qi Jiu,

13:34.030 --> 13:36.360
and you'll serve Marshal Qi alongside me.

13:37.670 --> 13:39.270
Hurry and thank General Yu.

13:40.630 --> 13:42.490
General Yu's life-saving grace—

13:42.960 --> 13:43.910
I, Qi Jiu,

13:44.720 --> 13:45.920
will never forget it.

13:50.630 --> 13:52.090
Over the past three years,

13:52.720 --> 13:54.650
Cuiqiao has taken great care of me.

13:56.480 --> 13:58.720
I was deeply moved and grateful,

13:59.510 --> 14:01.150
so we became sworn siblings.

14:05.750 --> 14:06.360
Sister.

14:07.550 --> 14:08.080
Brother.

14:10.320 --> 14:11.630
I am no longer

14:12.410 --> 14:13.280
that reckless boy

14:13.280 --> 14:15.040
who caused you all such worry.

14:16.480 --> 14:17.540
Unfortunately...

14:18.480 --> 14:19.840
you can no longer see it.

14:26.390 --> 14:27.120
Father.

14:28.840 --> 14:29.600
Aunt.

14:30.910 --> 14:31.670
Brother.

14:34.320 --> 14:35.920
Today is Tomb-Sweeping Day.

14:39.080 --> 14:41.340
I've come to burn some joss paper for you.

14:44.720 --> 14:46.150
You're all doing well

14:47.080 --> 14:48.480
on the other side, right?

14:50.960 --> 14:52.090
I'm living fine too.

14:57.150 --> 15:00.120
Although I now go by Qi Jiu,

15:02.910 --> 15:04.670
I have never once forgotten

15:06.000 --> 15:07.260
that my surname is Luo.

15:08.870 --> 15:12.150
Marshal Qi is currently fighting
Japanese pirates in the southeast.

15:12.150 --> 15:13.810
I've asked him for permission

15:14.320 --> 15:15.450
to return to Huizhou

15:16.000 --> 15:18.600
to purchase military supplies
for the Qi Army.

15:20.320 --> 15:21.120
I...

15:23.080 --> 15:24.440
am finally going home.

15:41.000 --> 15:41.720
Father.

15:43.150 --> 15:43.870
Aunt.

15:45.270 --> 15:46.000
Brother.

15:48.550 --> 15:49.720
One day,

15:51.030 --> 15:54.000
I will clear the stain from your names

15:56.510 --> 15:58.310
and bring your memorial tablets

15:59.480 --> 16:00.480
back here—

16:01.790 --> 16:02.960
back to our family.

16:05.670 --> 16:07.080
I will make the Luo family

16:09.270 --> 16:10.750
rise again.

16:36.450 --> 16:38.810
[Yan Bingyou,
Newly Appointed Ink Affairs Official]

16:44.280 --> 16:46.570
[Yan Xianglan,
Yan Bingyou's Adopted Daughter]

16:57.790 --> 16:59.320
All along this journey,

16:59.720 --> 17:01.780
the scenery here is truly beautiful.

17:02.360 --> 17:04.750
They say Huizhou is a place where the land
nurtures exceptional people.

17:04.750 --> 17:06.569
It truly lives up to its reputation.

17:06.569 --> 17:06.970
Quick,

17:07.030 --> 17:07.630
Xianglan,

17:07.680 --> 17:08.940
look at that mountain.

17:10.069 --> 17:12.240
There's an ancient pine growing there.

17:12.240 --> 17:12.880
Look.

17:14.440 --> 17:15.829
So beautiful.

17:18.790 --> 17:20.240
What's so great about it?

17:21.000 --> 17:22.589
Mountains, rivers—

17:22.589 --> 17:24.310
what do they have to do with me?

17:24.960 --> 17:26.440
Nowhere is as good as home.

17:28.680 --> 17:29.640
Missing home,

17:29.790 --> 17:30.480
right?

17:31.310 --> 17:32.270
Don't worry.

17:33.200 --> 17:34.960
Once I finish selecting the Tribute Ink,

17:34.960 --> 17:35.880
I'll take you

17:35.880 --> 17:37.540
straight back to the Capital.

17:39.400 --> 17:40.240
Father,

17:41.000 --> 17:42.510
don't try to comfort me.

17:43.000 --> 17:45.070
You were demoted and sent here.

17:45.350 --> 17:46.950
Whether we can go back or not,

17:47.310 --> 17:48.550
only heaven knows.

18:06.500 --> 18:07.200
How dare you!

18:07.200 --> 18:10.110
How dare you stop the carriage
of an imperial official?

18:10.110 --> 18:11.070
Lord Yan!

18:12.030 --> 18:15.160
I have specially prepared
a generous gift for you!

18:15.750 --> 18:16.920
Please accept it.

18:19.310 --> 18:20.400
Present it.

18:30.640 --> 18:31.350
Lord Yan.

18:38.460 --> 18:40.650
[Huizhou Ink Industry Records]

19:16.550 --> 19:17.790
Who are you?

19:18.030 --> 19:19.490
Qi Jiu, under Marshal Qi's

19:20.070 --> 19:20.880
command.

19:42.230 --> 19:43.100
Are you all here

19:43.130 --> 19:44.540
to welcome Lord Yan?

19:44.680 --> 19:45.310
Exactly.

19:45.830 --> 19:47.030
Sorry to keep you waiting.

19:47.030 --> 19:48.440
The Lord was delayed on the way,

19:48.440 --> 19:50.300
so he sent me ahead with a message.

19:56.270 --> 19:57.070
President Hu!

20:01.310 --> 20:02.030
Tian Ink.

20:02.960 --> 20:03.440
Here.

20:09.830 --> 20:10.440
Chen Ink.

20:13.830 --> 20:14.510
Pan Ink.

20:18.510 --> 20:19.200
Li Ink.

20:26.590 --> 20:27.590
There's one more.

20:36.960 --> 20:37.550
Sir,

20:38.400 --> 20:39.920
why does the Li family

20:40.110 --> 20:41.370
have two invitations?

20:41.680 --> 20:42.680
The Lord has his reasons

20:42.680 --> 20:43.940
for this arrangement.

20:45.310 --> 20:45.920
Please, everyone,

20:45.920 --> 20:46.790
return first.

20:46.880 --> 20:48.070
No need to wait here.

20:48.240 --> 20:49.270
The Lord has arranged

20:49.270 --> 20:50.550
an evening banquet at Sibao Restaurant

20:50.550 --> 20:52.210
to meet with fellow ink makers

20:52.270 --> 20:53.870
of Huizhou and share drinks.

20:54.680 --> 20:56.160
All invitations have been delivered.

20:56.160 --> 20:57.160
Please arrive

20:57.200 --> 20:58.350
on time tonight!

21:05.640 --> 21:06.440
President Hu,

21:07.270 --> 21:08.400
what is

21:08.400 --> 21:09.750
Lord Yan up to?

21:10.400 --> 21:12.830
Has it not always been customary
for the Literary Association

21:12.830 --> 21:15.550
to host a banquet
when a new official takes office?

21:15.550 --> 21:17.150
I didn't expect this either.

21:17.880 --> 21:19.070
Lord Yan

21:19.480 --> 21:21.180
doesn't play by the rules.

21:21.280 --> 21:22.810
[Invitation]

21:39.000 --> 21:39.800
Grandfather,

21:40.680 --> 21:41.550
what is this?

21:44.510 --> 21:47.000
The newly appointed
Ink Affairs Official, Lord Yan,

21:47.000 --> 21:48.750
is hosting a banquet
this evening at Sibao Restaurant,

21:48.750 --> 21:51.280
inviting all ink workshop representatives.

21:52.550 --> 21:54.210
I also received an invitation

21:54.780 --> 21:55.930
specially sent

21:55.960 --> 21:58.290
by Lord Yan through Seventh Grandmother.

21:58.980 --> 22:00.330
I imagine Lord Yan

22:00.360 --> 22:01.440
must already be aware

22:01.440 --> 22:03.000
that you swore a solemn oath,
sealed with the nailing of a tooth,

22:03.000 --> 22:04.330
never to make ink again.

22:04.790 --> 22:06.480
Otherwise, he wouldn't have deliberately

22:06.480 --> 22:07.830
given the invitation

22:07.880 --> 22:09.210
to Seventh Grandmother

22:09.240 --> 22:10.640
to pass along.

22:12.590 --> 22:13.750
Then do you think

22:14.960 --> 22:15.960
I should go...

22:18.160 --> 22:19.110
or not?

22:23.590 --> 22:24.750
If you don't go,

22:25.160 --> 22:27.400
slighting Lord Yan
would be a minor matter—

22:27.400 --> 22:28.920
I'm more worried that this will make

22:28.920 --> 22:30.030
Seventh Grandmother offend Lord Yan

22:30.030 --> 22:31.350
and end up in an awkward position.

22:31.350 --> 22:33.000
That would also be unfavorable for Li Ink.

22:33.000 --> 22:34.200
But if you go,

22:34.720 --> 22:36.160
then surely Lord Yan

22:36.550 --> 22:38.210
will make some sort of demand.

22:38.790 --> 22:40.480
And if it concerns ink-making,

22:40.480 --> 22:42.540
you'll be put in an awkward position.

22:45.400 --> 22:46.160
Yes.

22:56.310 --> 22:57.110
Grandfather,

22:57.590 --> 22:58.590
why don't I

22:59.200 --> 23:01.600
accompany you to the banquet this evening?

23:02.000 --> 23:02.960
You?

23:04.200 --> 23:04.920
Yes.

23:05.400 --> 23:07.400
All this time, you've been
the one protecting me.

23:07.400 --> 23:08.070
Today,

23:08.160 --> 23:09.960
let me stand behind you for once.

23:10.030 --> 23:11.590
I'm only a junior anyway.

23:11.720 --> 23:13.790
Even if I accidentally
say something improper,

23:13.790 --> 23:15.160
surely Lord Yan

23:15.200 --> 23:17.130
wouldn't stoop to arguing with me.

23:36.110 --> 23:36.880
Lord Yan,

23:38.480 --> 23:39.400
there is

23:40.030 --> 23:42.830
still an honored guest
who hasn't arrived, right?

23:43.030 --> 23:44.630
Please wait a moment longer.

23:45.110 --> 23:47.400
Master Qi of Yihousheng has arrived!

23:47.550 --> 23:48.350
Lord Yan.

23:58.110 --> 23:58.880
Lord Yan,

23:59.350 --> 24:00.400
I'm late.

24:01.200 --> 24:02.260
Please forgive me.

24:02.510 --> 24:03.200
It's fine.

24:05.110 --> 24:05.790
Everyone,

24:07.240 --> 24:08.160
allow me

24:08.160 --> 24:09.270
to introduce him.

24:10.310 --> 24:11.270
This is

24:11.640 --> 24:14.440
Master Qi of the Yihousheng Pawnshop.

24:15.750 --> 24:17.550
He is a man of considerable means

24:17.960 --> 24:20.090
and intends to enter the ink industry.

24:20.240 --> 24:21.590
Everyone here,

24:21.700 --> 24:23.560
you can get better acquainted
with Master Qi

24:23.560 --> 24:24.360
in the future.

24:25.440 --> 24:28.510
I hope all the senior figures
in the Huizhou ink industry

24:28.510 --> 24:29.960
will give me a chance.

24:36.240 --> 24:36.920
Everyone,

24:38.110 --> 24:39.000
I

24:39.070 --> 24:40.720
have only just arrived in Huizhou.

24:40.720 --> 24:43.130
In the future, regarding matters
of the ink industry,

24:43.130 --> 24:44.160
I will have to rely on you all

24:44.160 --> 24:45.620
for guidance and support.

24:50.240 --> 24:51.960
Allow me to drink this cup first
as a gesture of respect.

24:51.960 --> 24:52.590
Cheers.

24:53.640 --> 24:54.750
Cheers.

24:55.070 --> 24:56.130
After you, My Lord.

25:02.350 --> 25:03.000
Okay.

25:04.920 --> 25:07.000
On my journey here to Huizhou...

25:07.110 --> 25:07.880
Thank you.

25:08.800 --> 25:10.480
I must say the scenery
is truly magnificent,

25:10.480 --> 25:11.760
with white walls and black-tiled roofs—

25:11.760 --> 25:13.270
beauty beyond compare.

25:13.270 --> 25:14.310
Beautiful!

25:16.030 --> 25:17.790
And yet, in my heart,

25:18.270 --> 25:19.870
I felt a certain melancholy.

25:21.960 --> 25:22.960
Back then,

25:24.030 --> 25:25.160
Eighth Master Li,

25:27.030 --> 25:29.630
the head of
the Five Ink-making Grandmasters,

25:29.790 --> 25:31.270
supported Li Ink,

25:31.480 --> 25:35.590
helping elevate its craft
to near supremacy under heaven.

25:36.200 --> 25:39.480
The Li family held
the Tribute Ink commission,

25:40.680 --> 25:41.880
allowing

25:42.790 --> 25:46.720
Hui Ink to retain that honor
for more than a decade!

25:47.400 --> 25:48.270
And then?

25:48.790 --> 25:50.000
Misfortune struck.

25:52.000 --> 25:52.830
Fortunately,

25:53.560 --> 25:56.160
Luo Ink held the commission
for several years.

25:56.400 --> 25:57.200
But

25:57.550 --> 25:59.350
misfortune struck them as well.

25:59.920 --> 26:00.750
Nowadays,

26:01.790 --> 26:03.200
the Tribute Ink commission

26:03.200 --> 26:04.590
has been in other hands

26:04.750 --> 26:05.960
for years.

26:06.350 --> 26:07.070
Everyone.

26:11.400 --> 26:12.720
What's the reason?

26:12.830 --> 26:13.790
Was it

26:14.000 --> 26:15.260
a matter of ill timing?

26:16.960 --> 26:18.620
Unfavorable circumstances?

26:19.160 --> 26:20.160
Or...

26:21.400 --> 26:22.830
discord among people?

26:27.070 --> 26:29.160
You may all be wondering

26:29.590 --> 26:31.240
why I, upon arriving here,

26:31.590 --> 26:33.240
have broken convention

26:33.310 --> 26:35.680
and hosted this banquet myself.

26:35.790 --> 26:37.480
The truth is, I want to have

26:37.480 --> 26:39.240
a heart-to-heart talk with you all

26:39.240 --> 26:41.000
and offer a few words of counsel.

26:41.000 --> 26:43.650
The next selection
for Tribute Ink is approaching.

26:43.650 --> 26:44.930
This opportunity

26:44.950 --> 26:46.860
must not be missed.

26:47.160 --> 26:49.110
Everyone must work together.

26:50.270 --> 26:51.830
Let each contribute

26:51.920 --> 26:53.240
what they can—

26:53.480 --> 26:55.030
money, labor, or wisdom.

26:55.480 --> 26:56.830
Let us unite as one

26:56.920 --> 26:58.680
to restore glory to

26:58.720 --> 27:00.780
our Huizhou ink industry once again!

27:03.180 --> 27:04.640
My lord, your vision is truly

27:04.640 --> 27:06.110
far-reaching and admirable.

27:06.110 --> 27:07.550
Our Huizhou ink industry

27:07.600 --> 27:09.720
will certainly devote
itself wholeheartedly

27:09.720 --> 27:11.830
and will not fail
your painstaking efforts.

27:11.830 --> 27:12.440
Good.

27:12.640 --> 27:13.440
A toast to you, My Lord.

27:13.440 --> 27:13.960
Cheers.

27:21.310 --> 27:23.040
Lord Yan's words are profound,

27:23.510 --> 27:24.830
uniting the Huizhou ink industry

27:24.830 --> 27:25.960
as one.

27:26.550 --> 27:27.750
I deeply admire that.

27:28.350 --> 27:29.750
On this joyous occasion,

27:29.920 --> 27:31.920
I have also prepared a generous gift

27:32.430 --> 27:33.830
for you, My Lord,

27:34.350 --> 27:37.550
and all the esteemed seniors
of the Huizhou ink industry.

27:45.030 --> 27:45.830
Lord Yan,

27:46.110 --> 27:46.680
here.

27:57.750 --> 27:59.830
This box is rather interesting.

28:09.890 --> 28:12.280
[Purple Clouds from the East]

28:15.200 --> 28:16.200
Master Qi,

28:16.550 --> 28:17.550
could it be

28:18.070 --> 28:19.640
that what you're presenting me with is

28:19.640 --> 28:21.350
the long-lost

28:22.030 --> 28:23.480
ancient lacquer-soot ink?

28:23.480 --> 28:24.280
That's right.

28:24.680 --> 28:26.000
This piece of ancient lacquer-soot ink

28:26.000 --> 28:27.590
is named "Purple Clouds from the East."

28:27.590 --> 28:29.920
Legend has it that when Laozi was
traveling westward through the pass,

28:29.920 --> 28:31.120
the magistrate Yin Xi

28:31.270 --> 28:33.530
saw purple clouds drifting over the pass

28:33.550 --> 28:34.350
and knew

28:34.400 --> 28:35.550
a sage was about to

28:35.640 --> 28:36.550
pass by.

28:36.750 --> 28:37.510
And indeed,

28:37.920 --> 28:39.790
Laozi came riding upon a green ox.

28:39.960 --> 28:41.310
In honor of this tale, later generations

28:41.310 --> 28:43.030
created this ancient ink block,

28:43.030 --> 28:44.920
which has been passed down ever since.

28:44.920 --> 28:45.750
It symbolizes

28:45.880 --> 28:46.720
hope

28:47.030 --> 28:48.200
and a new beginning.

28:49.510 --> 28:50.960
And today, Lord Yan,

28:51.070 --> 28:52.510
you came bearing the Emperor's mandate,

28:52.510 --> 28:53.570
breathing new life

28:53.640 --> 28:55.750
into Shexian and even

28:56.000 --> 28:57.750
the entire Huizhou ink industry.

28:57.750 --> 28:58.480
Doesn't that

28:58.480 --> 29:01.410
align perfectly
with the spirit of this ancient ink?

29:02.240 --> 29:03.110
Good, good.

29:03.220 --> 29:04.540
Truly wonderful.

29:05.310 --> 29:06.200
Master Qi,

29:06.350 --> 29:07.920
you really

29:08.440 --> 29:10.110
got me with this gift!

29:10.110 --> 29:11.240
Thank you, Lord Yan.

29:15.350 --> 29:16.350
I suddenly

29:17.440 --> 29:18.550
have an idea.

29:19.310 --> 29:19.960
Everyone,

29:20.830 --> 29:22.160
if such a treasured ink

29:23.510 --> 29:24.400
could

29:24.920 --> 29:27.480
once again be recreated and passed down,

29:28.960 --> 29:29.750
then...

29:31.270 --> 29:33.000
wouldn't our chances of Hui Ink

29:34.440 --> 29:36.770
claiming the top honor be all but certain?

29:37.960 --> 29:38.920
Third Master Chen,

29:38.920 --> 29:40.920
your family

29:41.000 --> 29:43.110
built its name on lacquer-soot ink.

29:43.550 --> 29:45.280
Are you willing to give it a try?

29:46.640 --> 29:47.400
Lord Yan.

29:49.590 --> 29:50.960
The ancient lacquer-soot ink

29:50.150 --> 29:52.370
[Chen Junshan, son of the Chen family]

29:51.480 --> 29:53.340
used refined lacquer lampblack.

29:53.960 --> 29:55.000
But our family's

29:55.070 --> 29:56.400
lacquer-soot ink today

29:56.480 --> 29:58.240
uses coarse lacquer lampblack.

29:58.240 --> 29:59.880
The two differ greatly.

30:00.270 --> 30:01.000
However,

30:01.480 --> 30:03.210
the Chen family will certainly

30:03.350 --> 30:04.240
do its best

30:04.400 --> 30:05.240
to...

30:05.790 --> 30:06.850
recreate this ink.

30:11.240 --> 30:11.920
Lord Yan,

30:12.160 --> 30:13.960
although we Tian Ink didn't
start with lacquer-soot ink,

30:13.960 --> 30:15.820
we too are willing to try our best.

30:21.030 --> 30:21.750
Lord Yan,

30:22.160 --> 30:23.200
the Pan family

30:23.350 --> 30:25.350
will also do our best.

30:25.640 --> 30:26.270
Good.

30:31.110 --> 30:32.200
Eighth Master Li?

30:35.830 --> 30:37.070
Your Li Ink

30:37.400 --> 30:39.310
has a century of heritage.

30:39.830 --> 30:42.510
Recreating the ancient lacquer-soot ink

30:43.480 --> 30:44.920
must

30:45.590 --> 30:46.990
fall upon your shoulders

30:47.110 --> 30:48.880
on behalf of Li Ink.

30:49.720 --> 30:50.590
Lord Yan.

30:55.790 --> 30:57.520
You may not know this, Lord Yan,

30:57.790 --> 30:58.680
but he

30:58.880 --> 31:00.240
has been expelled from the clan

31:00.240 --> 31:02.030
and has sworn a solemn oath,
sealed with the nailing of a tooth,

31:02.030 --> 31:03.360
never to make ink again.

31:03.720 --> 31:05.580
But I, Jingdong, am confident...

31:19.000 --> 31:19.880
Lord Yan,

31:21.030 --> 31:24.070
the ancestral laws cannot be discarded,
and the clan rules cannot be violated.

31:24.070 --> 31:25.160
I'm sorry.

31:25.310 --> 31:26.840
Please forgive me, My Lord.

31:31.750 --> 31:33.810
As expected of you, Eighth Master Li.

31:34.590 --> 31:35.510
Your

31:36.000 --> 31:37.730
clan laws and ancestral rules—

31:38.110 --> 31:40.310
all perfectly reasonable, every word.

31:40.920 --> 31:41.920
Eighth Master Li,

31:43.000 --> 31:44.660
allow me to ask you something—

31:46.200 --> 31:49.240
do your clan rules and family affairs

31:50.480 --> 31:52.310
stand above

31:52.550 --> 31:53.880
the Emperor's affairs?

31:55.300 --> 31:56.580
You tell me.

32:01.750 --> 32:02.640
Lord Yan,

32:02.880 --> 32:04.680
I'm willing to try
in my grandfather's stead.

32:04.680 --> 32:05.350
Who?

32:09.200 --> 32:10.160
You?

32:10.750 --> 32:11.960
A little girl?

32:12.240 --> 32:13.070
Lord Yan,

32:13.370 --> 32:14.640
this commoner is Li Zhen.

32:14.640 --> 32:16.550
I've studied ink-making
under my grandfather for three years.

32:16.550 --> 32:17.680
Though I may not yet amount to much,

32:17.680 --> 32:18.750
I believe

32:18.750 --> 32:19.790
where there is a will, there is a way.

32:19.790 --> 32:20.510
Therefore,

32:20.790 --> 32:22.320
I'm willing to give it a try.

32:26.480 --> 32:27.720
With this cup of baijiu,

32:27.720 --> 32:28.440
I toast to you, Lord Yan.

32:28.440 --> 32:29.030
Hold on.

32:35.640 --> 32:36.440
Everyone,

32:38.390 --> 32:40.220
I truly never expected

32:42.790 --> 32:44.750
that the spirit of Li Ink

32:45.340 --> 32:47.820
would be found in a little girl!

32:48.640 --> 32:49.310
Girl,

32:50.270 --> 32:51.160
with this cup,

32:51.400 --> 32:52.440
I drink to you!

32:52.620 --> 32:53.250
Cheers.

33:09.960 --> 33:11.550
Congratulations, Lord Yan.

33:11.550 --> 33:13.720
If the ancient lacquer-soot ink
is successfully recreated,

33:13.720 --> 33:15.440
the revival of the ink industry in Huizhou

33:15.440 --> 33:17.040
may finally be within reach.

33:20.350 --> 33:21.440
I

33:21.860 --> 33:23.830
will contribute 100 taels of silver

33:23.830 --> 33:25.920
as a bonus for recreating

33:26.110 --> 33:27.840
the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

33:27.960 --> 33:29.070
Good, good.

33:30.000 --> 33:31.270
Master Qi is truly

33:31.350 --> 33:32.430
open-handed!

33:33.000 --> 33:33.600
Everyone,

33:33.830 --> 33:36.400
hurry and toast to Master Qi.

33:37.830 --> 33:38.510
Come on.

33:39.240 --> 33:40.440
Cheers. Cheers.

33:41.590 --> 33:42.270
Cheers.

33:48.790 --> 33:49.550
Master Qi,

33:50.400 --> 33:51.400
our Tian family

33:52.070 --> 33:53.130
offers you a toast.

34:16.290 --> 34:17.159
Lord Yan.

34:17.190 --> 34:18.190
Okay, okay.

34:17.239 --> 34:22.850
[Sibao Restaurant]

34:18.360 --> 34:19.920
I'm fine, I'm fine.

34:21.440 --> 34:22.030
I'm fine!

34:23.840 --> 34:25.900
On this fine evening, with good wine,

34:26.280 --> 34:27.739
we've all drunk together.

34:27.840 --> 34:28.880
Good, good.

34:28.880 --> 34:29.510
Everyone!

34:29.880 --> 34:31.070
No need to see me out.

34:31.280 --> 34:32.070
Lord Yan, careful.

34:32.070 --> 34:32.469
We take our leave.

34:32.469 --> 34:33.550
Please stay.

34:33.550 --> 34:34.710
Let's gather another day.

34:34.710 --> 34:35.880
Another day.

34:36.190 --> 34:37.320
Goodbye, goodbye!

34:37.440 --> 34:38.150
Okay, okay.

34:39.620 --> 34:40.790
Well...

34:41.230 --> 34:41.800
Okay.

34:42.030 --> 34:43.280
U-Until next time.

34:44.590 --> 34:45.710
Careful, Lord Yan.

34:46.840 --> 34:48.030
Until next time!

34:48.550 --> 34:50.230
We must drink together again!

34:50.760 --> 34:51.510
Miss Li Zhen.

34:52.920 --> 34:55.120
Master Qi, you're so generous tonight.

34:55.320 --> 34:57.320
You're indeed a great businessman.

34:59.240 --> 35:00.680
I'm just

35:01.070 --> 35:02.960
an unrefined merchant
of no great standing.

35:02.960 --> 35:06.290
I only offered a prize
to add to the excitement for everyone.

35:07.110 --> 35:09.230
Master Qi, upon first arriving in Huizhou,

35:09.230 --> 35:10.920
you made a bold entrance

35:11.030 --> 35:12.190
by publicly bidding 15 taels of gold

35:12.190 --> 35:13.450
for a jar of lampblack.

35:13.710 --> 35:14.550
Then tonight,

35:14.630 --> 35:16.480
with a single piece
of ancient lacquer-soot ink,

35:16.480 --> 35:18.190
you've won Lord Yan's favor

35:18.280 --> 35:20.540
and drawn all the families into the game.

35:20.760 --> 35:22.070
Even my grandfather,

35:22.430 --> 35:25.360
who had sworn an unbreakable oath
never to make ink again,

35:25.360 --> 35:26.590
was dragged into it.

35:27.880 --> 35:29.920
Master Qi, just how large a business

35:30.150 --> 35:32.280
are you planning in Huizhou this time?

35:34.320 --> 35:35.760
Since I've come to Huizhou,

35:35.760 --> 35:38.290
naturally it's to do business
related to ink.

35:38.400 --> 35:39.960
Paying a visit to Lord Yan

35:40.190 --> 35:41.510
was only proper.

35:41.800 --> 35:43.590
But what you just said...

35:45.480 --> 35:46.190
Fine.

35:46.550 --> 35:48.350
Even if this were a game of chess,

35:49.070 --> 35:51.110
didn't the seniors of the ink industry

35:51.110 --> 35:53.970
willingly take their places
as pieces on the board?

35:55.230 --> 35:56.440
But you, Miss Li Zhen—

35:56.920 --> 35:58.580
real skill breeds real nerve.

36:00.320 --> 36:01.360
I admire that.

36:02.150 --> 36:03.110
Perhaps one day,

36:03.710 --> 36:04.960
you and I

36:05.000 --> 36:06.280
could become friends

36:06.790 --> 36:08.650
and partners in business as well.

36:11.480 --> 36:12.880
It'd be better for us to keep our distance

36:12.880 --> 36:14.210
and not become friends.

36:14.400 --> 36:15.230
In business,

36:15.400 --> 36:16.440
once friendship is involved,

36:16.440 --> 36:17.400
it's hard to

36:17.590 --> 36:18.720
stay professional.

36:19.510 --> 36:20.110
Well said.

36:21.030 --> 36:22.400
You've taught me something today.

36:22.400 --> 36:23.440
Miss Li Zhen,

36:23.670 --> 36:25.670
there is still much time ahead of us.

36:31.230 --> 36:32.030
Grandfather,

36:32.070 --> 36:33.270
let's go home as well.

36:38.800 --> 36:39.710
Eighth Master Li,

36:39.710 --> 36:40.400
take care.

36:52.920 --> 36:54.190
I really didn't expect

36:54.550 --> 36:56.230
that the girl from the Li family

36:56.230 --> 36:58.290
would enter the game as well tonight.

36:59.670 --> 37:00.670
Indeed.

37:01.150 --> 37:01.880
Master,

37:02.360 --> 37:03.920
what should we do next?

37:07.800 --> 37:09.130
We'll take it as it comes

37:09.760 --> 37:11.420
and watch how things develop.

37:15.590 --> 37:16.840
Your actions tonight

37:17.280 --> 37:18.360
were too reckless.

37:19.710 --> 37:20.550
Grandfather,

37:20.710 --> 37:22.620
Lord Yan has pushed
you and Seventh Grandmother

37:22.620 --> 37:23.950
into such a corner.

37:24.150 --> 37:26.440
If no one had stepped forward
to take this on,

37:26.440 --> 37:27.110
would you

37:27.110 --> 37:28.710
really have wanted to
stand by and watch Li Ink

37:28.710 --> 37:32.110
and Seventh Grandmother
be put in such a difficult position?

37:32.960 --> 37:33.760
Besides,

37:33.840 --> 37:35.550
I'm your personally trained disciple

37:35.550 --> 37:36.550
and a junior.

37:36.710 --> 37:37.760
It's most fitting for me

37:37.760 --> 37:39.360
to be the one to step forward.

37:39.840 --> 37:40.670
Moreover,

37:40.880 --> 37:41.710
having the opportunity to

37:41.710 --> 37:43.400
recreate this ancient lacquer-soot ink

37:43.400 --> 37:45.400
will be a test of my ink-making skills—

37:45.400 --> 37:46.840
and an even greater benefit

37:46.840 --> 37:48.150
to my path in the craft.

37:50.000 --> 37:51.670
And think about it, Grandfather.

37:51.670 --> 37:54.320
If I actually succeed in recreating
the ancient lacquer-soot ink,

37:54.320 --> 37:55.710
I'll stand to gain both fame and fortune—

37:55.710 --> 37:58.070
that's hardly a bad thing, is it?

37:58.510 --> 38:00.550
Master Qi has already promised

38:00.630 --> 38:02.030
a reward of 100 taels.

38:02.360 --> 38:03.230
I certainly can't let

38:03.230 --> 38:04.760
those big, gleaming silver ingots

38:04.760 --> 38:06.160
slip through my fingers.

38:13.440 --> 38:14.240
Grandfather,

38:14.430 --> 38:15.690
I've already accepted the task.

38:15.690 --> 38:17.500
So stop looking so worried.

38:20.360 --> 38:21.880
Oh, you.

38:24.510 --> 38:25.840
Let's go, Grandfather.

38:26.070 --> 38:26.870
Let's go home.

38:42.070 --> 38:42.800
Master.

38:44.150 --> 38:46.190
I saw Miss Li Zhen on the street,

38:46.190 --> 38:48.670
failing to buy raw lacquer anywhere.

38:49.030 --> 38:52.000
I heard all the raw lacquer on the market

38:52.070 --> 38:53.920
has been bought up by the Tian family.

38:53.920 --> 38:56.110
Now, within all of Huizhou,

38:56.150 --> 38:58.610
raw lacquer is
nearly impossible to obtain.

38:59.480 --> 39:00.480
Tian family...

39:04.440 --> 39:05.510
Could it be

39:05.710 --> 39:08.480
they intend to monopolize
all the raw lacquer

39:09.150 --> 39:10.760
to prevent other ink workshops

39:10.760 --> 39:13.420
from recreating
the ancient lacquer-soot ink?

39:14.110 --> 39:15.840
Since they want to
prevent other ink workshops

39:15.840 --> 39:17.440
from recreating the ancient ink,

39:17.440 --> 39:19.110
I'll use raw lacquer

39:19.480 --> 39:22.150
as my bargaining chip
with the other workshops.

39:24.690 --> 39:25.280
Here's the plan—

39:25.280 --> 39:27.110
go find my sister later.

39:27.360 --> 39:29.280
She has some connections in Fujian.

39:29.280 --> 39:31.400
Ask her to help us source a shipment
of raw lacquer from there.

39:31.400 --> 39:32.110
Master,

39:32.770 --> 39:34.700
Miss Li Zhen needs raw lacquer too.

39:34.770 --> 39:36.610
Since we're buying some,

39:36.840 --> 39:38.240
should we get her some...

39:40.880 --> 39:42.360
Buying raw lacquer isn't something
that can be done

39:42.360 --> 39:43.440
in a day or two.

39:43.800 --> 39:46.130
Distant water can't put out a fire nearby.

39:46.630 --> 39:47.590
Besides,

39:48.440 --> 39:50.300
she's a girl with ideas of her own.

39:50.700 --> 39:52.360
She'll figure something out.

39:53.920 --> 39:55.380
Let's talk about it later.

39:57.350 --> 39:59.820
Since the Tian family has acted first,

40:00.090 --> 40:02.680
[Yaji Hall]

40:00.360 --> 40:02.800
let's go pay them a visit.

40:24.080 --> 40:27.160
[Changsheng Garden]

40:28.240 --> 40:31.490
[Boya Garden]

40:32.880 --> 40:34.710
Young Master, let's go!

40:45.710 --> 40:47.320
Changsheng Garden.

41:14.190 --> 41:15.920
Please take the seats of honor.

41:16.110 --> 41:17.590
I'll go get the master.

41:27.920 --> 41:30.370
[Deshan Hall]

41:45.330 --> 41:47.120
I told you to study at home,

41:47.150 --> 41:48.400
yet you ran off to the Li family

41:48.400 --> 41:51.190
and hung out with
that girl from their eighth branch.

41:51.190 --> 41:53.680
Do you think
I haven't been embarrassed enough?

41:53.680 --> 41:56.000
Father, I don't want to
return to the Capital,

41:56.000 --> 41:57.320
nor do I want to take the imperial exams.

41:57.320 --> 41:58.190
How dare you!

41:58.190 --> 41:58.840
Father.

41:59.880 --> 42:00.920
I have...

42:01.960 --> 42:03.820
just finished another inkstick.

42:05.000 --> 42:06.000
What do you think?

42:12.000 --> 42:13.400
Get out of my sight!

42:53.630 --> 42:56.350
[Aloeswood and Borneol Ink Recipe]

42:56.380 --> 42:59.210
[Master Ji's Ink Ink Craft]
